{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025350/extras/4b417e0635926044fb70bc2265d8cb38.poster.avif?t=1762428564\" width=260 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025350/extras/4b417e0635926044fb70bc2265d8cb38.webm?t=1762428564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>The experience ahead includes strobing imagery, sudden brightness, and abstract visuals that may not be suitable for all players.\u00a0</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>If you are sensitive to flashing lights or visual distortions, please proceed with care.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025350/extras/fc60a1f2cc4fd946a160c519862fc1c6.poster.avif?t=1762428564\" width=260 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025350/extras/fc60a1f2cc4fd946a160c519862fc1c6.webm?t=1762428564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Pentimento</strong> is an atmospheric narrative horror game set within an endless white void, where reality and conscience intertwine. You awaken with no memory of who you are and how you arrived, confronted only by a series of haunting paintings and a\u00a0mysterious\u00a0voice that\u00a0demands your judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0With every response, the atmosphere progressively shifts, and the presence behind the voice becomes clearer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The word Pentimento is derived from the Italian 'pentirsi', which means to repent or change your mind. Pentimento is a change made by the artist during the process of painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025350/extras/8ebe5c4fea2ceb89e31162d922740b74.poster.avif?t=1762428564\" width=260 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025350/extras/8ebe5c4fea2ceb89e31162d922740b74.webm?t=1762428564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Interactive morality</strong> \u2014 Decide how you interpret each painting through dialogue choices that reflect compassion, indifference, or cruelty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic atmosphere</strong> \u2014 Subtle changes in sound, imagery, and tone mirror the weight of your decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple outcomes</strong> \u2014 Your path leads to different endings shaped by your answers and the points you accumulate along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist, haunting style</strong> \u2014 A stark white world that becomes a canvas for guilt, memory, and consequence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025350/extras/6aff88ae5be85e171770ea54abe65084.poster.avif?t=1762428564\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025350/extras/6aff88ae5be85e171770ea54abe65084.webm?t=1762428564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Fire Craves Your Skin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025350/8c2b8ea461b78bdb7e1589a93453944dabaf60de.jpg"},{"name":"Do Not Delay The Inevitable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025350/a47b2f9aa3553b2e557ea4767072258031e61095.jpg"},{"name":"We WIll Break You Slowly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025350/86a3935044dbd499292bdc8ec5d9cca9b2fd7613.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025350?t=1762428564","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025350?t=1762428564","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025350/8e7c44fb162420a943b273eb41fadaba0472f5a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762428564","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025350/8e7c44fb162420a943b273eb41fadaba0472f5a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762428564","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The experience ahead includes strobing imagery, sudden brightness, and abstract visuals that may not be suitable for all players.\r\n\r\nIf you are sensitive to flashing lights or visual distortions, please proceed with care."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb